Keyframe_Animations:
# Keyframe Animations

```css
@keyframes spin { 
  0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
```
```css
@keyframes translateXLeft { 
  100% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
}
```
```css
@keyframes translateXRight { 
  100% { transform: translateX(100%); }
}
```

